Z||000000||pontiacs4me||03-06-2001||02:08 AM||||OK, Im driving around this afternoon and my wipers come on all of a sudden.  The selector was in the off position.  I switched it around and It wouldnt quit.  So I hit the squirter switch and it shot some wiper fluid and then it turned off and stayed off, for about half an hour then it did it again.  I noticed it did it when I turned on my turn signal, but only about 1 out of 10 times.  what is going on here?||||reg||1
